@startuml CU-26
actor "Cliente" as Cli
actor "Cajero" as Caj
boundary "«UI» Angular (Perfil/Comprobantes)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /receipts" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» ReceiptService / Receipt, Sale" as Model
database "«DB» PostgreSQL (Neon)" as DB

Cli -> UI : 1: Accede a "Mis comprobantes"
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /api/v1/receipts?page=1&size=20
Ctrl -> Model : 3: list(db, client_id, page, size)
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT Receipt JOIN Sale WHERE client_id = ?
Model --> Ctrl : 5: ReceiptPageResponse {items[], total, page, size}
Ctrl --> UI : 6: ReceiptPageResponse
UI --> Cli : 7: Lista paginada (tipo, RNC/CUF, total, fecha, sucursal)

Cli -> UI : 1: Click en un comprobante
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /api/v1/receipts/{receipt_id}
Ctrl -> Model : 3: get(db, receipt_id) con joins
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT Receipt + Sale + Branch + Details + Variant + Garment + Size + Color
Model --> Ctrl : 5: Receipt completo con items
Ctrl --> UI : 6: Detalle de comprobante
UI --> Cli : 7: Detalle completo (items, precios, totales, sucursal, RNC/CUF, URL documento)

note right of Caj : Cajero ve comprobantes\nde sus ventas en POS
Caj -> UI : 1: Accede a comprobantes POS
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /api/v1/receipts?sale_id=X (admin/manager)
Ctrl -> Model : 3: list(db, filters...)
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT con filtros
Model --> Ctrl : 5: ReceiptPageResponse
Ctrl --> UI : 6: Lista filtrada
UI --> Caj : 7: Comprobantes de la venta

@enduml